	(property "Description" "Waveshare RP2350-CAN, 21.00 x 51.00mm, 40 castellated pads with 1.0mm holes, Pico pinout: pads 1-20 left, 21-40 right, pitch 2.54mm, rows 17.78mm apart, USB-C at the 1/40 end. GP8-GP12 drive the on-board XL2515 CAN controller over SPI1: GP8 INT (active low), GP9 CS, GP10 SCK, GP11 MOSI, GP12 MISO. The 3-way CAN terminal (CANH, GND, CANL from the pad 20 side) at the 20/21 end has no pads. Pad grid from the Waveshare dimension drawing."
		(at 0 0 0)
